  <p id="c-sanguozhi-021-luchui-touhu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">自潁川<persName id="c-sanguozhi-021-luchui-touhu:p001:m0003" ref="37q_jvp_12z">邯鄲淳</persName></p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-021-luchui-touhu:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note">及黃初初，以<persName id="c-sanguozhi-021-luchui-touhu:p002:m0006" ref="37q_jvp_12z">淳</persName>爲博士給事中。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-021-luchui-touhu:p002:m0014" ref="37q_jvp_12z">淳</persName>作投壺賦千餘言奏之，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-021-luchui-touhu:p002:m0025" ref="tix_jqk_w1o">文帝</persName>以爲工，賜帛千匹。</p>
</text>
